{"step_index":2801,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T12:54:57Z","thinking":"If a process is already running, the system should prevent a new one from starting and inform the user. The `submitProcess` function checks for an ongoing process; if found, it displays a warning message. No further action will be taken within this function when a process is running, preventing potential conflicts or errors.\n\n\nInitial validation confirms file selection; the process now initializes the UI loading state.  A background process will be triggered with the selected files.  Upon process completion or if an existing process is detected, a system event is dispatched to update the UI.\n\n\nError handling is integrated to manage potential failures during process execution, including connection errors, and presents appropriate user feedback.  A separate function handles restarting a process, verifying no existing process is running before initiating the restart. The UI is updated to reflect the new process state and loading animation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add isProcessRunning checks in submitProcess and process_complete","EndLine":2095,"Instruction":"Update submitProcess and process_complete to manage isProcessRunning state","ReplacementContent":"async function submitProcess() {\n    const t = I18N[currentLang] || I18N.ar;\n    if (isProcessRunning) {\n        showToast(currentLang === 'en' ? 'A matching process is currently running. Please wait.' : 'توجد عملية مطابقة قيد التشغيل حالياً، يرجى الانتظار حتى تنتهي', 'warning');\n        return;\n    }\n    if (selectedShortageFiles.length === 0 || selectedWarehouseFiles.length === 0) {\n        showToast(t.select_at_least_one, 'error');\n        return;\n    }\n    \n    const btn = document.getElementById('btn-submit');\n    const progressModal = document.getElementById('progress-modal');\n    \n    // UI Loading state\n    isProcessRunning = true;\n    btn.classList.add('hidden');\n    progressModal.style.display = 'flex';\n    document.getElementById('progress-text').innerText = t.progress_init;\n    document.getElementById('progress-bar-fill').style.width = '5%';\n    startProgressTimer();\n    \n    const termEl = document.getElementById('pipeline-log-terminal');\n    if (termEl) termEl.innerHTML = '[System] Started pipeline...\\n';\n    \n    try {\n        const res = await window.pywebview.api.start_process(\n            JSON.stringify(selectedShortageFiles), \n            JSON.stringify(selectedWarehouseFiles)\n        );\n        if (res.success) {\n            currentProcessId = res.process_id;\n            \n            // If the backend detected an identical exact match that was already completed!\n            if (res.existing) {\n                showToast(t.process_existing, 'info');\n                // Simulate process_complete event\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('process_complete', {\n                        detail: {\n                            process_id: res.process_id,\n                            success: true,\n                            stats: res.stats\n                        }\n                    }));\n                }, 500);\n            } else {\n                // Background process started\n                showToast(t.toast_started, 'success');\n            }\n        } else {\n            isProcessRunning = false;\n            showToast((currentLang === 'en' ? 'Error: ' : 'خطأ: ') + res.error, 'error');\n            btn.classList.remove('hidden');\n            progressModal.style.display = 'none';\n            stopProgressTimer();\n        }\n    } catch (error) {\n        isProcessRunning = false;\n        showToast(currentLang === 'en' ? 'Connection error' : 'حدث خطأ أثناء الاتصال', 'error');\n        btn.classList.remove('hidden');\n        progressModal.style.display = 'none';\n        stopProgressTimer();\n    }\n}\n\n// --- Process Events ---\nwindow.addEventListener('process_update', (e) => {\n    const data = e.detail;\n    const progressModal = document.getElementById('progress-modal');\n    if (progressModal && progressModal.style.display === 'flex' && data.process_id === currentProcessId) {\n        const msgEl = document.getElementById('progress-text');\n        \n        if (msgEl && data.message) {\n            msgEl.innerText = data.message;\n        }\n        \n        const pb = document.getElementById('progress-bar-fill');\n        if (pb && data.message) {\n            let pct = 10;\n            if (data.message.includes('استخراج') || data.message.includes('Extracting')) pct = 30;\n            if (data.message.includes('مطابقة') || data.message.includes('Matching')) pct = 60;\n            if (data.message.includes('حفظ') || data.message.includes('Saving')) pct = 90;\n            pb.style.width = pct + '%';\n        }\n    }\n});\n\nwindow.addEventListener('process_complete', (e) => {\n    const data = e.detail;\n    isProcessRunning = false;\n    \n    if (!currentProcessId || data.process_id === currentProcessId) {\n        currentProcessId = data.process_id;\n        const btn = document.getElementById('btn-submit');\n        const progressModal = document.getElementById('progress-modal');\n        const t = I18N[currentLang] || I18N.ar;\n        \n        btn.classList.remove('hidden');\n        progressModal.style.display = 'none';\n        stopProgressTimer();","StartLine":1997,"TargetContent":"async function submitProcess() {\n    const t = I18N[currentLang] || I18N.ar;\n    if (selectedShortageFiles.length === 0 || selectedWarehouseFiles.length === 0) {\n        showToast(t.select_at_least_one, 'error');\n        return;\n    }\n    \n    const btn = document.getElementById('btn-submit');\n    const progressModal = document.getElementById('progress-modal');\n    \n    // UI Loading state\n    btn.classList.add(